 the merlin  government and their propaganda  unlike reiner annie's motivation was  never to become some marlene hero  or some savior of marley she just wanted  to survive  and come home to her father now let's  talk about  all four known jaw titan shifters  starting with  marcel and yeah there's a pretty big  turnover rate when it comes to the jaw  titan marcel and his younger brother  porco  both joined the warrior candidate  program at a young  age marcel inherited the jaw titan power  and his brother porco was on track to  inheriting the  armored titan but marcel did not want  his brother to become a titan shifter  and be condemned to die  young so behind his brother's back he  told his superiors that reiner should be  chosen as the next armored titan  instead of porco marcel felt guilty  about this  and so when he arrived on paradise along  with reiner bertolten annie  he told reiner the truth and when reiner  was about to be eaten by a mindless  titan  marcel felt responsible for protecting  reiner  after all if not for marcel's direct  intervention  reiner would never have even been in  this situation  so marcel decided to save reiner while  giving up his own life  in the process that mindless titan who  consumed marcel and became the next jaw  titan shifter  was of course emir not emir fritz but  the emir who would eventually become a  member of the 104th  training corps emir was an ldn girl born  in marley  around 75 years before the beginning of  the main attack on titan story  she was a homeless and nameless beggar  on the streets of marley  until she was taken in by an aldian man  who named her emir  after the progenitor emir fritz the man  then started up a cult around the mirror  claiming that this emir was some sort of  reincarnation of the ancient  eldian goddess emir fritz emir went  along with this charade because she  liked that everyone in the cult was nice  to her and treated her like a goddess  and she also liked that worshiping her  seemed to bring some happiness and hope  to these oppressed and unfortunate  people but this aldean cult was  eventually discovered by the marlene  authorities  and when that happened the man who had  taken amir in  betrayed her he claimed that the cult  was all her idea  and that she was the one who tricked him  emir did not deny the charges against  her  and she was subsequently arrested  paraded around the city streets as the  people jeered at her and pelted her with  stones  and then eventually she was taken to  parody's island and turned  into a mindless titan emir spent the  next  60 years wandering around the island as  a titan until the year  845 when reiner berthold annie and  marcel  accidentally wandered too close to her  titan as the mirror's titan was  activated by the presence of these  people  it was about to devour reiner but as  stated earlier  marcel pushed him out of the way and the  titan consumed marcel  instead some time later emir's human  form was finally restored as she  inherited marcel's jaw titan power  once she was human again emir found her  way inside the walls and assimilated  herself  into the society of parodies after  overhearing an ominous conversation  about an illegitimate child of the royal  family who was using the alias  crystallines  emir enlisted in the 104th training  corps with the intention of finding  krista  and protecting her from the people who  wanted to do her harm  now back to the previously mentioned  porco galliard  the younger brother of marcel during  their initial warrior candidate  training porco had an adversarial  relationship with reiner  porco thought that reiner was the worst  warrior candidate  and that his only strength was the fact  that he was an ideological zealot  obsessed with marlene propaganda  porco was the one who was about to  inherit the armored titan before his  brother marcel intervened to make sure  reiner gets the power  unfortunately for marcel porco still  ended up becoming a  titan shifter once emir decided to  willingly return to marley  in an attempt to protect historia she  was fed  to porco and so instead of becoming the  armored titan  porco became the jaw titan the fourth  and final jaw titan is falco grice  a 12 year old eldian boy born in liberio  he is a member of the current generation  of warrior candidates along with gabby  brown  like marcel and annie before him falco  is able to see  through marlene propaganda and he  realizes that becoming a titan shifter  is more of a curse than a blessing but  falco has strong feelings for fellow  warrior candidate  gabby and after some prodding from  reiner falco decided that he must become  the next armored titan  instead of gabby so that gabby can avoid  the curse of emir and live a full life  falco was never planning on becoming the  jaw titan but after accidentally  drinking some of zeke's spinal fluid and  then being turned into a mindless titan  by zeke  falco ended up devouring an injured  porco  and inheriting the jaw titan power from  him falco's jaw titan eventually becomes  the first  known flying titan if you're wondering  why a  jaw titan would have the ability to fly  you can check out my detailed video on  falco's flying jaw titan  link in the description okay now let's  talk about the two known  beast titans starting with zeke yeager  as mentioned earlier  zeke is the son of grisha and dina and  he has  royal blood he was born in liberio and  pressured to join the warrior candidate  program by his parents  who were dedicated eldian  restorationists they believe that if  their son could inherit one of the  shifters  his royal blood would make him an  exceptionally strong  titan and this would then allow him to  one day recapture the founding titan and  use it to restore  the aldean empire zeke was highly  intelligent  from a very young age and he quickly  realized that the restorationists  days were numbered because the marlins  were hot on their trail  believing that the destruction of the  restorationist was inevitable  zeke decided to betray his parents to  the marlins in order to save his own  life  and the lives of his grandparents zeke's  decision to betray his parents was also  influenced by the previous beast titan  tom zaver who was an important mentor  for zeke  during his time as a young warrior  candidate tom zaver also helped zeke  formulate a plan to capture the founding  titan and put an end to the suffering of  eldians  once and for all and speaking of tom  saver  he was an aldian from liberio who fell  in love with a marlene woman  because romantic relationships between  aldians and milan's were forbidden  tom hid his ldn armband whenever he was  around the woman he loved  and he concealed his eldean ethnicity  from her  the two were eventually married and had  a child together  but years later when the wife finally  found out that tom was actually an  aldian  she was so distraught that she married a  so-called elden devil  that she killed both herself and their  son  this shocking turn of events devastated  tom and he eventually came to the  conclusion that the world would be  better off if the aldians didn't  exist tom then joined up with the  warrior unit  became the beast titan and immersed  himself in titan research  while observing the next generation of  warrior candidates  tom took a liking to zeke and formed a  close relationship with him  tom would ultimately advise zeke to turn  his parents into the marlene authorities  in order to save himself and his  grandparents from certain doom  since the leaders of the restorationists  were about to be discovered anyway  turning his parents in proved zeke's  loyalty to marlei  and saved his life now let's talk about  peak finger  the only known cart titan shifter  pique is another eldian from liberio and  she lost her mother at a young  age on top of that her father was ill  and desperately needed medical care  in order to save her father's life pique  joined the warrior program  inherited the card titan power and  became an honorary merlin  which allowed her father to finally get  the medical treatment he needed  however pique noticed that her father  was saddened by the fact that she  decided to severely shorten her own life  in order to prolong his peak's ultimate  goal is to free the aldian people in the  barrio and the rest of marley  from oppression before her 13-year term  as the card titan runs out  during the mission to paradise pique was  initially kept back in marley along with  zeke  but she later joined zeke on the island  in a supporting role  and finally we have the only known  warhammer titan shifter  before that power was consumed by aaron  i am of course talking about lara tiber  the younger sister  of willie tiber we don't know much about  lara other than the fact that she is a  member of the tibers  a family of alien nobles who plotted  with king carl fritz to put an end to  the alden empire on the continent  the tibers have had the warhammer titan  in their possession for many generations  and they receive special treatment in  marlei when compared to the other  eldians the tibers are respected as  national heroes for turning against  eldia and supporting marlet  and as such they are allowed to live in  peace outside of the aldian internment  zones  the tibers are not subject to any of the  oppressive laws that apply to the other  aldeans in marlei  in fact it is strongly implied that the  tiber family actually controls the  nation of marley from behind the scenes  as the head of the tiber family willie  tiber had led everyone to believe that  he was the warhammer titan shifter but  the real warhammer titan was actually  his sister  lara and that is it the backstory of  every known titan shifter in the attack  on titan story  if you enjoyed this video and you want  to see more videos like it  including videos about the unique powers  of all of the titan shifters  check out our extensive and growing  attack on titan playli